        <briefdescription>
<para>Compute the probability of collision in the encounter plane (Alfano 2007, Equation 2) </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The encounter (U-W) plane coordinates are aligned with the principal axes of the combined covariance, centered on the combined covariance. The hard-body circle is centered at (R0 * sin(phi), R0 * cos(phi)).</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>aR0</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The distance from the origin to the center of the hard-body circle (i.e. the miss distance) [m] </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>aPhi</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The angular position of the center of the hard-body circle, measured from the W axis </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>aSigmaU</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The combined standard deviation along the U principal axis [m] </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>aSigmaW</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The combined standard deviation along the W principal axis [m] </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>anObj</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The combined hard-body radius (OBJ) [m]</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The probability of collision </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
